			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>We are looking for <strong>Madonna</strong>'s fans around the world who want to help us to manage <a href="https://plus.google.com/u/0/108271241338297580687/posts">DrownedMadonna.com Google + Page</a>.</p>
