		<item>
			<title>Sorry for being offline!</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/623-sorry-for-being-offline.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/623-sorry-for-being-offline.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>We apologize for being offline for several hours today. Our server occurred a problem, and it took a while to fix it.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The site may have some other problems next couple of days. BUT, do not worry: we will fix them as well.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Thank you for all your love and support,</p>
<p> </p>
<p>DrownedMadonna.com Team</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Web</category>
			<pubDate>Mon, 05 Mar 2012 16:10:44 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Confirmed: Madonna &amp; Guy Oseary working on a Dance Channel for YouTube</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/492-madonna-guy-oseary-working-on-a-dance-channel-for-youtube.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/492-madonna-guy-oseary-working-on-a-dance-channel-for-youtube.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>It's being rumoured for months, and now it's official.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> and business partner and manager <strong>Guy Oseary</strong> are working on a dance channel for <span class="taxInlineTagLink"><strong>YouTube</strong>. <strong>Madonna</strong> confirmed it to the Los Angeles Times. It's on her long list of interests for 2012.</span></p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Web</category>
			<pubDate>Fri, 27 Jan 2012 21:25:11 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>It's Time for You to post Your LUV for Madonna and make it Viral!</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/392-its-time-for-you-to-post-your-luv-for-madonna-and-make-it-viral.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/392-its-time-for-you-to-post-your-luv-for-madonna-and-make-it-viral.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>We at <strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> just launched a new web tool - <a href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/luv" target="_self">www.drownedmadonna.com/luv</a> - to let<strong> Madonna</strong>’s fans  post their LUV for <strong>Madonna</strong> and make it go viral with Social Networks.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>A brand new <strong>Madonna</strong>’era is coming soon. It’s time to start promoting the Queen of Pop with all our LUV.</p>
<p>When you post a text, a video, an audio clip, etc here, other  <strong>Madonna</strong>’s fans can add their LUV by clicking the heart. Sharing the  items with Social Media, make it go viral… and this helps <strong>Madonna</strong> be  more social talked!</p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/luv">Enter now, and start posting your LUV Content and lUV other fans' submissions!</a></p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Web</category>
			<pubDate>Thu, 05 Jan 2012 17:01:52 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
