		<item>
			<title>Drowned Madonna on Google+</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/217-drowned-madonna-on-google%20.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/217-drowned-madonna-on-google%20.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>We invite you to follow <strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> on <a href="https://plus.google.com/108271241338297580687" target="_blank" title="DrownedMadonna.com on Google+">Google+</a> to be always up-to-date and never miss a news. Enter <a href="https://plus.google.com/108271241338297580687" target="_blank" title="DrownedMadonna.com on Google+">https://plus.google.com/108271241338297580687</a> and then click "Add to Circles".</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We also invite you all to follow us on <strong>Facebook</strong> (<a href="http://www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna" target="_blank" title="DrownedMadonna.com on Facebook">www.facebook.com/drownedmadonna</a>) and <strong>Twitter</strong> (<a href="http://www.twitter.com/drownedmadonna" target="_blank" title="DrownedMadonna.com on Twitter">www.twitter.com/drownedmadonna</a>) as thousands Madonna fans have already done.</p>
<p>Thank you all!</p>
<p> </p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://plus.google.com/108271241338297580687" target="_blank" title="DrownedMadonna.com on Google+"><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/googleplus.png" border="0" alt="DrownedMadonna.com on Google +" width="363" height="366" style="border: 0;" /></a></p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Web</category>
			<pubDate>Tue, 08 Nov 2011 09:17:56 +0000</pubDate>
